WEBVTT

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:47.470
Lorucca and his people brought a lot of
stuff, but they just left it lying around.

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:51.680
Be grateful they brought
it this far for us at all.

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.680
Move the G-Self to the front hangar.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.390
Okay. I'll do that.

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:00.230
- Bellri looks exhausted, huh?
- ﻿I know, right?

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:02.780
Ah. That's it, right? The Kashiba Mikoshi.

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.440
Yes, it is!

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:09.740
It'll go to Sankt Porto and they'll
hold the Advent Festival there.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.540
Noredo, look above the Kashiba Mikoshi.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.790
That's the Crescent Ship, huh?

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.960
It's massive!

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:25.920
You are the heirs of the proud
traditions of the Zacks Corps.

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:28.510
If we let the Earthnoids
continue to disrespect us,

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:31.640
it will hurt the credibility
of the Hermes Foundation.

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:33.320
Huh? What?

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:35.310
Huh? Yeah.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:41.360
"The Kashiba Mikoshi is leaving
port, so don't use beam rifles."

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:43.530
I've heard it a hundred times!
Enough already.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:48.450
Gavan! Don't throw things!

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:52.240
Don't forget that this is an operation
to restore our reputation.

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:02.130
Rockpie, if you don't stop the
Gavan Team, there will be trouble!

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:03.880
Please, wait a moment longer.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:05.750
Are we still not able to leave?

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.300
The Commander just chewed me out!

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:08.930
Well?

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:11.260
There are 30 electrodes to deal with here!

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:14.850
The Crescent Ship is still here,

00:03:14.850 --> 00:03:17.270
but that lady commander is still going out?

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:19.230
Captain Mask is out training.

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:26.280
Since Klim used his status as the president's
son to let the Salamandra out to play.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:30.360
Towasanga does want our ships.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.280
If we can secure the G-Self,

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:35.950
negotiations with General Dorette
will go more favorably for us.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:43.590
Is that true?

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.090
I thought the Bifron was damaged.

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:50.720
Take in the YG-111 before the Gavan Team can!

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.930
Roger that! I'm heading out!

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:56.640
I'll test the Beam Manteau.

00:04:01.770 --> 00:04:04.650
That was 10% output.

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:07.320
- If I get serious—
- Don't break the YG!

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:11.280
- You're there to capture it!
- ﻿Yes! Understood!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:16.280
This is what I've got at maximum
magnification. Can you see?

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.240
I've got a clear picture.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:21.790
For this to be the ship that
carries photon batteries...

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:24.040
Don't you think they're
mocking us Earthnoids?

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:25.790
What do you mean?

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:27.250
They're trying to assert
their authority, you know?

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:32.300
It's as if they're forcing us to respect
them with this gaudy design.

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:35.550
Kerbes, look above the Kashiba Mikoshi.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:38.560
- The Crescent Ship, right?
- ﻿Yeah.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:42.440
They're starting up their main engines.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:45.310
Don't they have to spend
three days just idling?

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:50.070
They're about to leave on a long distance
trip to the Venus Globe after all.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.780
So the fare is high?

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:55.660
If you're not a member of the Hermes
Foundation, you can't get aboard.

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:57.530
Oh. Kerbes.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:59.240
Yeah. I detected them.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.500
It's the Gavan Team.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:06.080
They plan to attack if we move
out from in front of Sakunsoon.

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:08.800
Megafauna! Did you get that?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.510
Prepare the Recksnow's cannon.

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:14.300
- G-Self to the foredeck.
- ﻿Roger!

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.760
He says he wants the Reflector
Pack brought to the foredeck too.

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:20.560
Thanks for adjusting the Reflector Pack.

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.230
Just doing my job.

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:25.140
It's the Kashiba Mikoshi.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.110
The Crescent Ship too.

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:33.780
Once it finishes loading photon batteries
onto the Kashiba Mikoshi,

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.910
will it return to the Venus Globe?

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:38.370
- What's your problem?
- ﻿You're working too hard.

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:43.040
Because I need to help Miss Aida
carry out what she's planning.

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:45.500
You want to be a good little brother.

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:47.710
I'm not used to it yet.

00:05:47.710 --> 00:05:50.840
Bell, you're no genius and
you aren't tough either.

00:05:50.840 --> 00:05:54.630
That's why I want to at least make sure I can
use what Lorucca and his people got for us.

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:58.970
So, when exactly are you going to get around
to moving the G-Self to the foredeck, huh?

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:00.680
Bellri.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:04.930
If we move away from the Kashiba
Mikoshi, we'll come under attack.

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:08.860
However, if we approach the
Crescent Ship above Cyrano-5,

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:10.230
we won't be attacked.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:13.190
Thank you for moving the G-Self.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:15.110
It was no big deal.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:17.030
Anyway, what's up with the Garanden?

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:19.410
It's not in the Apache Military Port.

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.120
It's not?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.910
The Crescent Ship should be enhanced if we
can bring the G-Self into contact with it.

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:26.580
Yeah, that's right... Okay.

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.790
Oh? They have that sort of relationship?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:32.550
Then are the Crescent's systems similar?

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:36.380
"Well, I suppose so" is about all l can say.

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:39.010
It comes from the Rose of
Hermes Blueprints apparently.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.760
You heard what she said!

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.220
That's pretty suspicious!

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:46.730
Soon, the Megafauna and Kashiba
Mikoshi will move apart.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:50.860
It would be absolutely unacceptable to have
a stray round strike the Kashiba Mikoshi.

00:06:50.860 --> 00:06:52.730
You hear me, Gavan?

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.610
You punks from the fleet
don't need to come out.

00:06:55.610 --> 00:07:00.620
If you disperse Minovsky Particles,
I will halt you people by force.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.200
Men, do you understand?

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:06.960
Because so much as one shot from a rifle
would become an issue politically.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.160
What's wrong?

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:12.750
The Towasangan Mobile Suits in the direction
of the moon are acting strangely.

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:13.880
You think they want to ﻿start a Mobile Suit battle?

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.550
The Dorette Army wants the data from the
G-Self we sent out on reconnaissance.

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:22.720
So, because the Garanden
tried to destroy the G-Self,

00:07:22.720 --> 00:07:24.890
they now want to take it themselves.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.900
- ﻿I'll open the hatch.
- Go ahead.

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:38.650
- Someone came out of the Mack Knife!
- ﻿Camera!

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.370
That's...!

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:45.240
- ﻿You've got to be kidding me!
- What is it?

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.710
What have you come here to—

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:53.170
You can't use radar, so you have
to look around better.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:54.170
At what's around you.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.880
When I looked around, I saw Raraiya!

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.590
It's Universal Standard, so...

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:03.800
Adam Smith, we have hostiles
coming in through the front.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:06.680
But there's a Mack Knife and
that big thing out front.

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.140
They're taking aim at us.

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.930
Another unit is following after them.

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:11.440
That must be Klim then.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:14.190
But the Megafauna is still on
schedule with my initial plan.

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:16.150
- Captain.
- C-Can we do it?

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:18.900
Bell's G-Self is on the foredeck.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:21.280
- ﻿Will you be heading out?
- ﻿Of course.

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:22.990
It's dangerous down below, you know?

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:25.410
The bridge might get shot.

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:28.240
The intruders are attempting
to open the gate.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:31.120
Send out the Grimoires on the rear deck.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.080
The hatch opened!

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:38.710
That person in the pilot suit...

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:40.760
The airlock is on the starboard side, right?

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:51.390
The G-Self was constructed in Towasanga,

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:53.600
so you have to give it back!

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:57.020
It <i>is</i> you, Manny!

00:08:57.860 --> 00:08:59.980
Why did you come here like this?

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:02.990
Because! If we give the
G-Self back to Towasanga,

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:05.030
they say all three of our
ships can go back to Earth!

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:09.240
They'll resupply the Megafauna
and Garanden as well!

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:11.040
No can do!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.080
The G-Self belongs to me and Miss Aida!

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.210
What?

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:18.250
Manny!

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:20.340
Do you read me over the contact link?

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.090
There's a Mobile Suit battle on deck.

00:09:23.090 --> 00:09:25.010
Please, take shelter deeper inside.

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:27.600
- Why?
- Behind the Mack Knife?!

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:31.310
What are you doing?

00:09:31.310 --> 00:09:34.020
What do you think you're doing
on the Megafauna's deck?

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:37.020
It's the Hecate and Jahannam.

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:38.940
Mick and Captain Klim?

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:45.030
We're right next to the Kashiba Mikoshi!
What is wrong with you Earthnoids?!

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:47.660
The Salamandra's genius and
the hothead girl, huh?

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:49.830
Coming late to the party...

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:53.160
You cannot hope to fight a close
quarters battle in something like that!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:55.620
Don't underestimate me!

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:58.670
Impossible!

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.380
Then I'll cut your power in half!

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:04.760
I told you not to underestimate me!

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.430
Barara, calm down!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.510
We can use a beam shower if it comes to it,

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:12.010
but there's a unit of Towasangan
suits closing in as well.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:15.480
The Towasangans will take
advantage of our battle.

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:18.900
The Kashiba Mikoshi is still in sight.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:21.360
But there's a Knossos out as well.

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:27.950
Looks like there's some infighting
aboard the Megafauna.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:31.490
We can't let this get out of hand, Mashner!

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:33.160
I'm well aware.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:38.500
If a beam were to scratch the Kashiba Mikoshi
while the Foundation's envoy is watching,

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:40.750
our army would be disbanded at once.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:44.090
I won't allow that to happen.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:10.400
This is my territory.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.400
I can't let these Earthnoids
do as they please here!

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:19.830
Noredo, take shelter as close to
the center of the ship as you can.

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:22.160
You too, Manny! Those people...

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.000
Manny, this way!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.420
- ﻿But...!
- Bellri, what are you doing?

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:29.920
I'll pull some dummy meteors
in front of the hangar!

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:32.590
I get it! I'll help!

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:38.050
Both Grimoires to the front. Close the hatch.

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.010
The Arcane has sortied.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:41.350
Wh-What?

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:50.520
No! I can't see ahead!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.980
Gisela! Don't you have a monitor for Steer?

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:56.570
A monitor for looking ahead
of us? There should be one.

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:57.950
- ﻿They're here.
- Huh?

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:02.330
Curse you, woman!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:07.170
I won't forgive you for kicking my Captain!

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:09.840
If a man gets kicked, it's his own fault!

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:14.800
Okay, I've hooked up the
center camera to this.

00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.970
So you can see what's in front of us!

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:19.720
What? It's tiny!

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:23.970
It's cushioning their fall.

00:12:23.980 --> 00:12:25.930
Raraiya, we can just tie them down lightly.

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:27.390
I know!

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:32.230
This isn't your playground!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.530
A Towasangan unit!

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:40.410
Gavan, you hooligan, relying on numbers!

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.080
I have no time for Mashner's boytoy!

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:49.000
Towasanga's people will not use rifles.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.460
They're SU-Cordists, after all.

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.130
Capture the ones above too!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.720
It grabbed me?!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:01.510
You should've just stayed home
and let Mashner play with you.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:05.270
He cut me!

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:09.230
Capturing the 111 is my duty.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.690
That Earthnoid used missiles?!

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:16.280
Captain!

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:18.570
I had no other choice
in order to save Barara!

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:20.490
C-Captain.

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:23.200
I thought we were going to lose
to their superior numbers.

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.580
The Megafauna's accelerating!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.370
Can you see it, Captain?

00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:32.080
It's in sight now, yeah?

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:33.540
Gisela, XO!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.590
23 degrees up.

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:37.630
- ﻿You're wrong!
- What?

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.510
Sh-She is?

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:44.850
30 degrees up, 3 degrees to port will
take us right behind the Crescent Ship.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:45.970
Okay!

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.730
- They're ahead of us.
- ﻿Right!

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:52.900
The Crescent Ship?!

00:13:56.360 --> 00:14:00.150
If the G-Self leaves, they
won't target the Megafauna!

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:06.080
The G-Self has come out! Mask!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:09.080
You've come out for me to
catch you, have you?

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.660
But, there's these Towasangans!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.750
He got me!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:16.500
Filthy Earthnoids!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.840
Huh? Mashner has come out?

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:23.890
I ordered you to shoot!

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:25.680
Mashner, stop it!

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:27.470
Fire #3 and #4 as well!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.690
Are you trying to get me executed?!

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:34.940
- ﻿Do you think they'd stop if asked nicely?!
- Right, ma'am...

00:14:38.190 --> 00:14:40.320
Good, the pilot got away.

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:43.410
We weren't supposed to be able
to fight with beams here.

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:45.280
Is the Crescent Ship over there?

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.490
Take in the 111!

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:52.160
G-Self, let Colonel Cumpa
analyze your machine!

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:53.460
Bellri!

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:57.630
The G-Self will be a useful
hostage, so lend it to me!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:59.630
You're all here to fight over it!

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:07.720
I will not let you people have it!

00:15:11.730 --> 00:15:13.520
Now you've done it. Earthnoid.

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.310
Mashner, back me up

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.070
The beam interference is spreading!

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:25.070
We are being flung away!

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.710
The 111 has changed!

00:15:32.710 --> 00:15:34.660
Go back to your countries!

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:38.500
I've got the output now!

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:50.680
They're closing in on the Crescent Ship!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:52.350
Stop Rockpie!

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:04.280
Who ordered you to shoot?!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:06.450
The Crescent Ship is right in front of us!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:09.240
It's still idling now.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.910
Even though they're heading
back to the Venus Globe.

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:14.750
Fleeing into the Crescent
is our only option now!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.170
Maximum combat speed! What?!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.000
It looks like the G-Self
is having a hard time.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.130
That's no ordinary electromagnetic barrier.

00:16:22.130 --> 00:16:24.090
The barrier has formed a belt around it.

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:27.050
Plasma equalization, maybe? It's coming!

00:16:27.050 --> 00:16:28.390
They're going to catch us!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.430
It's the shining one!

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:39.100
Make it!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.480
Is this guy a monster?

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.950
End of the line, 111 pilot!

00:16:48.950 --> 00:16:51.410
The G-Self has a Photon Shield as well!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.920
Please, don't get close to the Crescent Ship!

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:01.840
- We'll be cursed!
- Maximum combat speed!

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:05.210
Stop, please, Captain!

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.880
- ﻿Let's decelerate!
- ﻿No!

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:08.680
Go to our absolute maximum combat speed!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.680
Rockpie's putting his life on the
line, so we have to save him!

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:16.680
Is this that beam coating stuff?

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:19.980
It's blocking the Gaitrash's
beam saber with its hands!

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:27.860
Rayhunton sign. Rayhunton sign.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:40.750
Raraiya, cut the wires on the dummy meteors!

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.540
Steer! Do you get it?

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:51.380
Oh, my SU-Cord!

00:17:51.390 --> 00:17:53.390
Steer!

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:55.470
- Easy. Easy. Easy.
- ﻿Gisela, you too!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:00.310
Miss Aida, we're going to hit it!

00:18:00.310 --> 00:18:03.400
Let's make sure we don't! Raraiya!

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:04.900
Right!

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:06.400
Don't fall, okay?

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:07.980
Steer! The right side!

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:12.490
No!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:14.450
Keep her steady, Steer!

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:16.410
We got through!

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.040
- Did we get through?
- ﻿We're within the Crescent Ship.

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:31.380
Rockpie!

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:34.390
- They're going to court martial us for this!
- ﻿Rock, are you alive?!

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:35.550
Commander!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:38.890
I-I did the very best I could!

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:39.770
I'm sure you did!

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:40.430
It's ahead of us!
I'm sure you did!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:42.140
I know that, Rock.
What is it?

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.310
Rockpie!

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:43.770
Either evade it or shoot!

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.360
When I face this way, the vibrations
in the metal grow stronger.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:57.990
Is this what Lorucca and the
others were trying to tell me?

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:01.540
But what Flaminia said...

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:05.330
The Rose of Hermes Blueprints
are the stuff of legends.

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.040
But no one has ever...

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.130
...confirmed they exist.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:25.810
W-Well, if it's a door, it should open...

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:28.860
It's opening? Isn't it too big?

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.590
This isn't a factory.

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:54.220
That pattern!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.220
I see!

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:04.020
I only think this isn't a joke because
their shapes are a perfect match.

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:08.320
I'm here.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.290
Beginning activation of ordinary operation.

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:36.220
Huh? It just said it was
starting up ordinary operation.

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:39.180
Then, how were they piloting it up until now?

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:42.180
Bellri, are you in here?

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:44.680
Yes. I'm just up the slope.

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:47.520
You came in here with the G-Self?

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:49.770
Huh? Shouldn't I have?

00:20:49.770 --> 00:20:52.610
This is the main engine room.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:56.320
What? So this was the main engine room!

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:58.740
Think about its location.

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:02.410
- ﻿It's the same as our metals?
- Yeah.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:04.790
I think you could have used yours as well.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:06.710
I'm impressed you figured it out.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.290
I haven't done a thing.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:12.040
After fighting with that crazy Mobile Suit,

00:21:12.040 --> 00:21:15.260
I just puzzled things out, following
what Mom and Dad set up.

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:17.720
What our mom and dad set up?

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:20.180
Thanks to this guy here.

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.890
Ah! What about everyone on the Megafauna?!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.060
They made it to this ship.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.560
- ﻿Everyone is okay.
- I see!

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:35.020
I wouldn't have been able to come
here otherwise, you know?

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:36.480
That's right!

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:41.700
The captain of the
Crescent Ship is thanking us.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.870
- You can hear him, right?
- Huh? Oh, right.

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:47.540
Thank you for unlocking
the Higgsroot Capsule.

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:53.040
If you hadn't, we would have had to
idle for another two days

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:56.300
before the Crescent Ship could leave port.

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:02.470
Does it have the same restrictions
as the photon batteries?

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:03.640
You think?

00:24:00.300 --> 00:24:03.430
While we're aboard the ship
heading for the Venus Globe,

00:24:03.430 --> 00:24:06.350
with running marathons, doing routine
maintenance on our machines,

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:09.350
and repairing the Megafauna,
we're super busy!

00:24:09.360 --> 00:24:12.400
But for some reason, an incomprehensible
group boards the ship,

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:15.440
shouting "Nobody move!"
which lets me get some rest.

00:24:15.440 --> 00:24:18.490
Because I was knocked out cold.

00:24:18.910 --> 00:24:23.410
Next time on Reconguista in G,
The Venus Globe Gang.

00:24:23.410 --> 00:24:25.540
Go and brag to everyone
once you've watched it!
